{"ticker":{"symbol":"228760.KQ","name":"지노믹트리","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":8930.0,"change_pct":-0.02510917030567683,"market_cap":219186806784.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":8600.0,"week52_high":33300.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"South Korea","city":"Daejeon","employees":79,"website":"https://genomictree.com","business_summary":"Genomictree Inc., a biomarker-based molecular diagnostics company, develops and commercializes molecular diagnostic products for the detection of cancer and various infectious diseases. The company offers EarlyTect C, a screening method for early diagnosis of colorectal cancer; EarlyTect L for detection of epigenetic markers associated with lung cancer in pulmonary nodule patients; and EarlyTect B for detection of genetic and epigenetic markers associated with bladder cancer in hematuria patients. It also provides AccuraDTect SARS-CoV-2 RT-qPCR kits, test providers, and nucleic acid transport medium products. The company was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Daejeon, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"바이오마커 기반 분자진단 기업인 지노믹트리(주)는 암 및 각종 감염병 진단을 위한 분자진단 제품을 개발 및 상용화하고 있습니다. 회사는 대장암 조기진단을 위한 선별검사법인 얼리텍C(EarlyTect C)를 제공하고 있다. 폐결절 환자의 폐암과 관련된 후성유전적 마커 검출을 위한 EarlyTect L; 혈뇨 환자의 방광암과 관련된 유전적 및 후생적 마커를 검출하기 위한 EarlyTect B. 또한 AccuraDTect SARS-CoV-2 RT-qPCR 키트, 테스트 제공업체 및 핵산 수송 배지 제품도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2000년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 대전에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":29865674700.0,"operating_income":2405361740.0,"net_income":-6630819370.0,"eps":-316.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":3418009370.0,"operating_income":-17303489220.0,"net_income":-8756036780.0,"eps":-449.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":2362308210.0,"operating_income":-15313390590.0,"net_income":-